    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d244">

                <pb facs="0278" n="188" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav02/pg188"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/1901</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Italy</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-06-04T15:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 4, 1918, 3
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1395. Your 1669, May 28, 3 p.m.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d244-f1"/> Deeply interested
                    in program of League for Regeneration of Russia with which this Government, in
                    the main, agrees. Would be pleased to have the league communicate confidentially
                    details of its plan of action, for consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
